    "constitution.showcase.whatIntro": "Constitution is an interactive political-economy simulator. Eight sliders measure the four pillars of any society:",
    "constitution.showcase.whatFloorBold": "floor below",
    "constitution.showcase.whatFloorParenthetical": "(UBI, education, healthcare),",
    "constitution.showcase.whatLawBold": "law above",
    "constitution.showcase.whatRotationBold": "rotation & multiple statuses",
    "constitution.showcase.whatRotationConjunction": "(sortition, axes of respect), and",
    "constitution.showcase.whatGrowingBold": "growing pie",
    "constitution.showcase.whatOutroIntro": "Move them and watch which historical regime the system slides toward. 10 classified regimes — from",
    "constitution.showcase.whatOutroTo": "to",
    "constitution.showcase.whatOutroTotalitarian": "Totalitarian Dictatorship",
    "constitution.showcase.whyHeading": "Why exactly 8 sliders",
    "constitution.showcase.pillar1Title": "Floor below",
    "constitution.showcase.pillar1Text": "UBI, education, healthcare. When people have something to lose, the existential motive to take by force disappears.",
    "constitution.showcase.pillar2Title": "Law above",
    "constitution.showcase.pillar2Text": "The oligarch loses in court too. The law applies equally to the minister and the fisherman. It reduces intra-elite conflict.",
    "constitution.showcase.pillar3Title": "Rotation & status",
    "constitution.showcase.pillar3Text": "Athenian sortition + multidimensional respect. Whoever wants to leave, leaves; whoever needs to rise, rises — and no one fights over a single prize.",
    "constitution.showcase.pillar4Title": "Growing pie",
    "constitution.showcase.pillar4Text": "Without positiveSum, no reform holds. Feudalism lasted 800 years precisely because the economy wasn't growing.",
    "constitution.showcase.quotesHeading": "Standing on whose shoulders",
    "constitution.showcase.quote1": "Open orders are regimes in which elites compete but do not destroy one another, because the rules are the same for everyone.",
    "constitution.showcase.quote2": "Inclusive institutions make the pie grow. Extractive ones freeze it.",
    "constitution.showcase.quote3": "Common resources are best governed by polycentric communities, not a centralized state.",
    "constitution.showcase.quote4": "Whoever makes the decision must personally bear its consequences.",
