    "pricing.forIndustry.banks.name": "Banks & fintech",
    "pricing.forIndustry.banks.hero": "Signing, audit, and payments in one infrastructure",
    "pricing.forIndustry.banks.problem": "Banks end up gluing together DocuSign + audit systems + a payment gateway + an AI support chat. Each integration is a separate 6-month project and an outside compliance risk.",
    "pricing.forIndustry.banks.why1": "QSign + QRight + QPayNet under one SOC2/ISO27001 perimeter",
    "pricing.forIndustry.banks.why2": "Data localization in KZ / RU / EU with no stack migration",
    "pricing.forIndustry.banks.why3": "An audit log for every step of an operation — a single record in the registry",
