    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.free.q1": "Can I stay on Free forever?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.free.a1": "Yes. Free has no trial timer. If you hit the limits, upgrade at any time.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.free.q2": "Which module should I pick on Free?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.free.a2": "Most people choose QRight (to register ideas) or CyberChess. QRight + QSign gives you a minimal IP protection loop.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.free.q3": "What happens if I exceed the limits?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.free.a3": "The operation will return 429 quota_exceeded. No data is lost. You can wait for next month or upgrade.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.lite.q1": "What's included in Lite?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.lite.a1": "Any one AEVION product of your choice for $19/month — full access to it. For example, only CyberChess or only HealthAI.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.lite.q2": "Can I change the selected product?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.lite.a2": "Yes. You can change the selected product in your account at any time — no extra charge.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.lite.q3": "How is Lite different from Medium?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.lite.a3": "Lite is 1 product of your choice. Medium ($29) gives you 10 ready-made products right away (CyberChess, HealthAI, Multichat, QCoreAI, Smeta, and more).",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.lite.q4": "Is the annual discount real?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.lite.a4": "Yes — pay for a year and you only pay for 10 months (2 months free): $240 instead of $288.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.medium.q1": "What's included in Medium?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.medium.a1": "10 ready-made products with one subscription: CyberChess, HealthAI, Multichat, QCoreAI, Smeta Trainer, QAI, QLearn, QNews, QStore, QMedia.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.medium.q2": "How is Medium different from Full?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.medium.a2": "Medium is 10 consumer/prosumer products. Full ($49) is the entire ecosystem of 30+ products (including QRight, QSign, IP Bureau, and the fintech stack).",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.medium.q3": "How many QCoreAI tokens does Medium include?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.medium.a3": "10,000,000 tokens per month. On Full — 50,000,000.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.medium.q4": "Annual discount?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.medium.a4": "$390 per year instead of $468 — 2 months free.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.full.q1": "What's included in Full?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.full.a1": "The entire AEVION ecosystem (30+ products): everything in Medium plus QRight, QSign, IP Bureau, QTrade, QPayNet, QContract, QBuild, and more.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.full.q2": "Are team seats available?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.full.a2": "1 user by default. Team roles, multi-seat, and organization-level audit logs are available on Enterprise.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.full.q3": "Audit and logs?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.full.a3": "A full audit log across all modules (via the QRight registry). Export to JSON/CSV.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.full.q4": "Annual discount?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.full.a4": "$890 per year instead of $1,068 — 2 months free. You can cancel with a refund for unused time.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.pro.q1": "What's included in Universe that Full doesn't have?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.pro.a1": "Everything in Full, plus priority access to new modules, 200M QCoreAI tokens/month (vs 50M), the AEVION Agent — one window for text or action, offline/local models at $0 per token, and a 6h support SLA.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.pro.q2": "Why is Universe priced above Full — what do I actually get for the difference?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.pro.a2": "Universe is the flagship \"all of AEVION\" seat: the same all-module access as Full, plus 4x the AI token allowance, the earliest access to new agentic and site-builder features, and faster support — priced above what a single-purpose AI subscription (at its top tier) would cost you, because you're getting the entire platform, not one product.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.pro.q3": "Is Universe the same as Enterprise?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.pro.a3": "No — Universe is self-serve, single-seat, at a fixed monthly price. Enterprise is a negotiated contract for teams/orgs with dedicated infrastructure, custom compliance, and multi-seat licensing.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.pro.q4": "Can I cancel or downgrade?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.pro.a4": "Yes, cancel any time — unused annual time is refunded, same as the other tiers.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.enterprise.q1": "What's included in Enterprise?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.enterprise.a1": "Dedicated infrastructure (VPC or on-prem), custom SLA starting from 1 hour, SOC2/ISO27001 package, unlimited seats and tokens, a CSM, and input into the roadmap.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.enterprise.q2": "Minimum contract length?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.enterprise.a2": "Usually 12 months. A 3-month pilot is available on request.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.enterprise.q3": "Jurisdictions and compliance?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.enterprise.a3": "We support GDPR, KZ data localization, and RU Federal Law 152-FZ. NDA/DPA/MSA available per standard templates or your own.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.enterprise.q4": "How do I get started?",
    "pricing.tierDetail.faq.enterprise.a4": "Click \"Contact sales\" — our Customer Success team will reach out within 24 hours with a proposal and demo.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.audience.free.who": "For those getting to know AEVION for the first time: students, founders at the idea stage, researchers.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.audience.free.usecase1": "Register your first idea in QRight",
    "pricing.tierDetail.audience.free.usecase2": "Sign a trial document via QSign",
    "pricing.tierDetail.audience.free.usecase3": "Play a game of CyberChess",
    "pricing.tierDetail.audience.free.usecase4": "Complete the Globus onboarding",
    "pricing.tierDetail.audience.free.notFor": "Not suitable for commercial use under regular load.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.audience.lite.who": "For those who need one AEVION product: a CyberChess player, a HealthAI user, an estimator in Smeta Trainer.",
    "pricing.tierDetail.audience.lite.usecase1": "Full access to one product of your choice",
