    "build.guide.ledePart1": "Posting a project and a job listing is ",
    "build.guide.ledeFree": "free",
    "build.guide.ledePart2": ", no agency advance required. AI helps filter applications, and a trial task tests skills in practice, not just on paper. You pay ",
    "build.guide.ledeOnlyHire": "only for a hire",
    "build.guide.ledePart3": ": the fee starts at 12% and drops to 4% as you hire more, plus cashback in AEV tokens. Below is the whole path, step by step, from your profile to payment.",
