    "build.guide.stepsHeading": "Six steps to your first hire",
    "build.guide.step1Title": "Fill out your employer profile",
    "build.guide.step1Body1": "Add your company or crew name, city, and a short bio. Your profile is your storefront — the more complete it is, the more candidates trust your listings. The ",
    "build.guide.step1Badge": "✓ Verified",
    "build.guide.step1Body2": " badge can be requested from your profile — we verify within 1–2 business days.",
    "build.guide.step1Cta": "Go to profile →",
    "build.guide.step2Title": "Create a project",
    "build.guide.step2Body1": "A project is a container for one or more job listings (e.g. \"Office fit-out, 180 m²\"). Add a title, scope of work, city, and budget. Posting a project is ",
    "build.guide.step2Free": "free",
    "build.guide.step2Cta": "Create a project →",
    "build.guide.step3Title": "Publish a job listing",
    "build.guide.step3Body1": "Inside the project, click ",
    "build.guide.step3AddVacancy": "\"+ Add job listing\"",
    "build.guide.step3Body2": ": role, requirements, salary, skills. You can add screening questions — AI scoring (step 4) will use the answers. The more specific the description, the better the response. Posting a job listing is ",
    "build.guide.step3FreeAnyPlan": "$0 on any plan",
    "build.guide.step4Title": "Review applications",
    "build.guide.step4Intro": "For every application, you can see:",
    "build.guide.step4Item1Bold": "AI score 0–100",
    "build.guide.step4Item1Text": " — Claude evaluates the candidate's answers to your questions and shows the score and red flags right on the card.",
    "build.guide.step4Item2Bold": "Video resume",
    "build.guide.step4Item2Text": " — if the candidate recorded one, watch it before the call.",
    "build.guide.step4Item3Bold": "Trial task",
    "build.guide.step4Item3Text1": " — offer a small ",
    "build.guide.step4Item3Italic": "paid",
    "build.guide.step4Item3Text2": " task to test the skill in practice, not just on paper.",
    "build.guide.step4Item4Text1": "The entire application funnel can be exported to ",
    "build.guide.step4Item4Bold": "CSV",
    "build.guide.step4Item4Text2": " (name, city, AI score, status).",
    "build.guide.step4Cta": "Search candidates →",
    "build.guide.step5Title": "Message directly",
    "build.guide.step5Body1": "Direct messages with a candidate come ",
    "build.guide.step5NoWall": "without a premium paywall",
    "build.guide.step5Body2": ". No need to pay to \"unlock contact\" — you can message anyone who applied.",
    "build.guide.step5Cta": "Messages →",
    "build.guide.step6Title": "Hire — and pay only for the hire",
    "build.guide.step6Body1": "No agency advance at all. The ",
    "build.guide.step6PayPerHire": "Pay-per-Hire",
    "build.guide.step6Body2": " fee is charged only when you actually hire. By default it's ",
    "build.guide.step6BaseFee": "12%",
    "build.guide.step6Body3": ", and it ",
    "build.guide.step6Falls": "drops as your hire count grows",
    "build.guide.step6Body4": " — down to ",
    "build.guide.step6MinFee": "4%",
    "build.guide.step6Body5": " at the top loyalty tier. Plus, every paid order earns ",
    "build.guide.step6Cashback": "AEV cashback",
    "build.guide.step6Body6": " (2% → 5% by tier).",
    "build.guide.loyaltyCap": "Loyalty",
