    "build.help.workers.q1": "How do I find a vacancy and apply?",
    "build.help.workers.a1": "Go to the \"Vacancies\" section. Use filters for city, skill, and salary. Click \"Quick apply\" right from the list, or open the vacancy for the full form with questions.",
    "build.help.workers.q2": "What is a Trial Job?",
    "build.help.workers.a2": "A paid test task from the employer. After approving your application, the employer may offer a Trial — a small paid task to confirm your skills. You get paid once it's done.",
    "build.help.workers.q3": "How do I get the ✓ Verified badge?",
    "build.help.workers.a3": "Go to \"Profile\" → the \"Verification badge\" section → click \"Request verification\". Attach a link to your LinkedIn, portfolio, or certificates. We review within 1-2 business days.",
    "build.help.workers.q4": "What is AEV cashback?",
    "build.help.workers.a4": "When you pay for orders (subscription, Trial tasks) you earn 2% back in native AEV tokens. You can claim them into your AEV wallet from the \"Pricing\" section.",
    "build.help.workers.q5": "How do I set up a Job Alert?",
    "build.help.workers.a5": "In the \"Profile\" section → \"Job alerts\", set your keywords and skills. You'll get an email whenever a new vacancy matches your criteria.",
    "build.help.workers.q6": "Who can see my profile?",
    "build.help.workers.a6": "Your public profile at /build/u/[id] is visible to everyone. Go to Profile → \"Open public profile\" to see how employers view you.",
    "build.help.employers.q1": "How do I create a project and add vacancies?",
    "build.help.employers.a1": "Click \"New project\", describe the site and budget. Once created, the \"+ Add vacancy\" button appears right on the project page.",
    "build.help.employers.q2": "How much does posting a vacancy cost?",
    "build.help.employers.a2": "$0. Free on all plans. We only charge a Pay-per-Hire commission (from 6% on the Gold tier) when you actually hire.",
    "build.help.employers.q3": "What is AI scoring of applications?",
    "build.help.employers.a3": "If the vacancy has screening questions, Claude AI scores each candidate's answer on a 100-point scale. The score and red flags are shown on the application card.",
    "build.help.employers.q4": "How do I export all applications to Excel?",
    "build.help.employers.a4": "Open the vacancy page → the \"Applications\" section → the \"↓ CSV\" button. The file includes names, email, city, AI score, and status.",
    "build.help.employers.q5": "How does boosting a vacancy work?",
    "build.help.employers.a5": "Boost pins the vacancy at the top of the /build/vacancies feed for 7 days. 1 boost = 990 ₽. The Pro plan includes 5 boosts/month.",
    "build.help.employers.q6": "How do I verify a candidate?",
    "build.help.employers.a6": "In the Admin → Users section, find the candidate and click \"verify\". The ✓ badge will appear on their public profile.",
    "build.help.guidesIntro": "Step-by-step guides:",
    "build.help.guidesEmployer": "for employers",
    "build.help.guidesWorker": "for job seekers",
